      "id": 17729,
      "name": "The Girl With No Name",
      "username": "The_Girl_With_No_Nam",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-01-24T06:24:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I hope I'm not breaking any rules by posting a fanfiction directly into a comment like this. I don't have an account on any big sites, so this was all I could do. Sorry...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>----------</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"You lost them.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"I... Yeah, I lost them.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Expatriette sighed, covering her face with her hand.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"<em>How</em> did you lose the keys? Seriously, how?\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Well, uh...\" Setback thought for a while. \"I was doing my laundry, and I guess they must have been in my jeans pocket or something.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"You kept the keys to Faye's house in your jeans!?\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"It seemed like a good idea at the time! I mean, what if she went on holiday, and needed us to feed her cat or something?\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"She doesn't&nbsp;<em>own</em> a cat, Pete.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"...Oh yeah.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"So you kept the spare key to the biggest collection of magical texts and artifacts in the US in your jeans, in case Faye needed you to feed her nonexistent cat.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Setback looked over at Mr. Fixer, who shook his head silently.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"...Is there any answer that doesn't end with Faye punching me?\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Loading Pride with a heavy sigh, Expatriette aimed at the lock before unloading bullets into it, shredding it to pieces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"You're paying for the door repair.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The vigilante pushed open the door, only to come face-to-face with Nightmist.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"What on earth do you think you're doing?\" the mage asked, utterly puzzled.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Setback mused that if he could see through the bandana Mr. Fixer was wearing, the martial arts master would be rolling his eyes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"Faye!?\" Expatriette asked, startled. \"Uh... Pete lost his key, so I... blew out the lock.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"And you didn't knock, because...?\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"...\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"...\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"...How much do locks cost again?\" Setback wondered aloud.&nbsp;</p>",
